CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: HEADING AUTOPILOT ANTI-WINDUP PID CONTROLLER
BTW Closed loop heading autopilot with saturated anti-windup clamping
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A KP ITZ 1.8
I HAS A KD ITZ 3.2

HOW IZ I COMPUTE_RUDDER_PID YR ERR_DEG AN YR RATE_DEG_S
