    I HAS A D ITZ PRODUKT OF KD AN RATE_DEG_S
    I HAS A RAW ITZ DIFF OF P AN D
    FOUND YR I IZ MATH_CLAMP YR RAW AN YR -35.0 AN YR 35.0 MKAY
IF U SAY SO

